## Recommended Roadmap

| Phase | Features | Timeline |
|-------|----------|----------|
| **Phase 1** (Quick Wins) | Paper Templates, Advanced Search, Smart Notifications | 2-3 weeks |
| **Phase 2** (Core UX) | Smart Paper Builder, Student Analytics, AI Enhancement | 4-6 weeks |
| **Phase 3** (Growth) | PWA Offline Mode, Interactive Quiz Modes | 4-6 weeks |
| **Phase 4** (Platform) | Student Portal, Collaborative Papers | 6-8 weeks |

> [!TIP]
> **Phase 1** items are low-hanging fruit that dramatically improve daily teacher workflow. Start here for maximum impact with minimum engineering effort.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The **Student Self-Study Portal** (#10) is the highest strategic value feature — it shifts Prosno from B2B (teacher tool) to B2B2C (teacher + student platform), unlocking viral growth through students sharing with classmates.
